  "details": "## Description\n\nAny sticker that has transparency on the Unity 6 branch of VRChat will not calculate the SDFs properly and the vectors will cover all the area that is supposed to be transparent.\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\n1. Place down any sticker that has transparent parts\n\n2. See the broken vectors\n\n## Details\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1879-ecdbfcd219-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR",
